Custody/support evidence
- Income proof: last 2–3 years of tax returns, pay stubs, bank statements.
- Parenting records: calendars, school attendance, medical records, daycare bills, photos, communications re scheduling/pickups.
- Any court orders or prior family-court filings relating to custody/support.

