- Preserve everything now. Courts take spoliation seriously; a preservation letter and immediate backups are low cost and high value.
- Don’t discuss case strategy with your former partner or post details online—keep communications through counsel where possible.
- Ask Robert about protective orders before producing sensitive business documents.
