8. Motions & emergency relief
- Should we consider immediate motions (motion for injunctive relief, to preserve evidence, or for expedited discovery)?
- Are there any time-sensitive remedies available in Minnesota law for alleged NDA breaches?

9. Privilege / confidentiality issues
