  - What ESI (emails, Slack, Google Drive, Dropbox, server logs) should we prioritize and how should it be collected to preserve metadata and chain of custody?
  - Are there confidentiality or privilege concerns (trade secrets, privileged communications) and how do we protect them (protective order)?

