  - Names, contact info, and short summaries of what each witness can testify to
  - Any written witness statements or affidavits you can obtain now

- Preservation documentation
  - Any steps you’ve already taken to preserve evidence (emails sent instructing hold, device storage copies)
  - List of devices and accounts that may contain discoverable material

Immediate actions to consider (what you can do now)
